{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "This differentiation is furthered by the inheritance of wealth and the consequent inheritance of gentility.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["This", " differentiation", " is", " further", "ed", " by", " the", " inheritance", " of", " wealth", " and", " the", " consequ", "ent", " inheritance", " of", " gent", "ility", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The warros of uniforms and liveries may be roughly divided into two classes: the free and the servile, or the noble and the ignoble.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " war", "ros", " of", " uniforms", " and", " liver", "ies", " may", " be", " roughly", " divided", " into", " two", " classes", ":", " the", " free", " and", " the", " serv", "ile", ",", " or", " the", " noble", " and", " the", " ign", "oble", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Each will therefore serve about equally well during the earlier stages of social growth.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Each", " will", " therefore", " serve", " about", " equally", " well", " during", " the", " earlier", " stages", " of", " social", " growth", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The modern organization of industry works in the same direction. Also, by another line.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " modern", " organization", " of", " industry", " works", " in", " the", " same", " direction", ".", " Also", ",", " by", " another", " line", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Come, come! I'm getting really tired of your absences.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Come", ",", " come", "!", " I", "'m", " getting", " really", " tired", " of", " your", " abs", "ences", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Saturday after Saturday comes around, and I can have no hope of hearing your knock at the door, and then being told that Missy has come. Oh dear.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Saturday", " after", " Saturday", " comes", " around", ",", " and", " I", " can", " have", " no", " hope", " of", " hearing", " your", " knock", " at", " the", " door", ",", " and", " then", " being", " told", " that", " Miss", "y", " has", " come", ".", " Oh", " dear", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The first well-established seat of the church was in the pretty little town of Kirkland, Ohio, almost within sight of Lake Erie, and here soon rose the first temple of modern times.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " first", " well", "-established", " seat", " of", " the", " church", " was", " in", " the", " pretty", " little", " town", " of", " Kirk", "land", ",", " Ohio", ",", " almost", " within", " sight", " of", " Lake", " Erie", ",", " and", " here", " soon", " rose", " the", " first", " temple", " of", " modern", " times", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Who began the quarrel? Was it the Mormons?", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Who", " began", " the", " quar", "rel", "?", " Was", " it", " the", " Mormons", "?"], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The army found the people in poverty and left them in comparative wealth.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " army", " found", " the", " people", " in", " poverty", " and", " left", " them", " in", " comparative", " wealth", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "At the inception of plural marriage among the Latter-day Saints, there was no law, national or state, against its practice.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["At", " the", " inception", " of", " plural", " marriage", " among", " the", " Latter", "-day", " Saints", ",", " there", " was", " no", " law", ",", " national", " or", " state", ",", " against", " its", " practice", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
